('China Venture Capital and Private Equity Association', 'China Venture Capital and Private Equity Association', 'China Venture Capital and Private Equity Association (CVCA) is a Venture Capital industry trade group that itself says "promotes the interest and the development of venture capital ("VC") and private equity ("PE") industry in the Greater China Region."
