('Ballmer Group', 'Ballmer Group', 'The Ballmer Group is an American investment company based in Bellevue, Washington, that serves as a family office to manage the wealth of Steve Ballmer, the former CEO of Microsoft. The purpose of the Ballmer Group is to advance economic mobility.
